"title":"4 · 携带工具结果再次调用模型","edgeId":"result","nodeId":"model","message":"追加 assistant 的调用消息，以及 tool: 晴，22°C，tool_call_id=call_1；连同历史再次发送。","explanation":"模型必须看到调用和结果，才能依据观测继续推理；漏掉回传边会在这里停止。"},{"title":"5 · 返回最终文字","edgeId":"answer","nodeId":"final","message":"assistant: 当前晴，22°C，适合出门。无 tool_calls。","explanation":"这次模型没有再请求工具，框架退出循环并把回复交给用户。这是示意数据，并非实时天气查询。"}],"teaching":{"feedback":{"invalid-edge":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"当前定义没有这条消息通路，请检查发送方与接收方。"}]}]},"unexpected-edge":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这条额外连接跳过了"},{"type":"text","text":"模型","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"读取工具观测的过程。工具提供数据，"},{"type":"text","text":"模型","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"结合请求形成最终回答。"}]}]},"missing-required-edge":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"缺少必要的数据连接。检查工具观测是否回到了"},{"type":"text","text":"模型","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"；"},{"type":"text","text":"模型","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"没有收到结果，就没有再次决策的依据。"}]}]}},"explanation":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"模型","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"只知道这次请求携带的消息。"},{"type":"text","text":"框架","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"先"},{"type":"text","text":"执行工具","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，再把"},{"type":"text","text":"调用意图","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"与对应结果一同发回"},{"type":"text","text":"模型","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"；工具输出本身不等于最终回答。沿高亮连线核对每次信息由谁产生、交给谁。"}]}]}},"correctEdgeIds":["request","call","result","answer"],"initialEdgeIds":["request","call","result","answer"]}'::jsonb,success_feedback=null,retry_feedback='{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"模型","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"只知道这次请求携带的消息。"},{"type":"text","text":"框架","marks